This repository includes material from tau2-bench
(https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench), taken at commit
b7ea9074c1cba482b30687fecdb5c8425fd6f619.

What it covers: corpus/base_prefix/tau2-airline/system.txt, which contains
tau2-bench's airline policy and agent instruction, and
corpus/base_prefix/tau2-airline/tools.json, which is generated from its
airline tool definitions. Every request stored under corpus/requests/ and
every record that reproduces that text is covered as well.

